# W9-T4a interpolation2.text emitter golden (value-level parity
# with export_interpolation; format contract with parse_interpolation2).
#
# The Rust emitter (`pinyin-emitter`) is run over T2's counts of
# `segmenter-ngseg.txt` (T1's output) with the pinned model20 phrase
# index supplying phrase text (`<start>` for sentence_start). The full
# interpolation2.text is several MB, so instead of tracking it we pin
# its exact shape and a dependency-free FNV-1a 64-bit checksum of the
# emitted bytes (`\data model interpolation` / `\1-gram` / `\2-gram` /
# `\end`, `\item` lines with phrase text, no λ).
unigrams 138096
bigrams 199
fnv1a64 a6fd9465851d35de
